LOG ANALYSIS:
`````````````
# cd /var/log/httpd/

LogFormat "%h %l %u %t \"%r\" %>s %b \"%{Referer}i\" \"%{User-agent}i\"" combined

Like:
`````
192.168.206.100 - - [23/Sep/2025:15:18:17 +0530] "GET /favicon.ico HTTP/1.1" 404 196 "http://cdac.com/" "Mozilla/5.0 (X11; Linux x86_64; rv:102.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/102.0"






%h	: Host IP [ Client's IP ]
%l	: [Remote logname] - "hyphen"
%u	: userid
%t	: [day/month/year:hour:minute:second zone]
			day = 2*digit
			month = 3*letter
			year = 4*digit
			hour = 2*digit
			minute = 2*digit
			second = 2*digit
\"%r\"	:	The request line from the client is given in double quotes
%s	:	HTTP Status Code
%b	:	The size of the object returned to the client
\"%{Referer}i\"	:	The "Referer" HTTP request header.
\"%{User-agent}i\"	: User-Agent

